    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "不可控系统具有不受控制输入影响的特定模态或子系统，这通常是因为系统的某些部分在物理上与输入断开；正如在模态规范型中所见，模态状态变量在 B_m 矩阵中对应的元素为零。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Uncontrollable systems have certain modes or subsystems that are unaffected by the control input, often because parts of the system are physically disconnected from the input, as seen in modal canonical form where a modal state-variable has a zero entry in the B_m matrix.",
